                                "sense_id": "f9dbe600-dc0d-35fe-8333-118b1f99ae39",
                                "text": "A blokart (say blow-cart) plays to the penchant that Kiwis and Aussies have for pushing the limits in search of fun. It’s a ground-hugging, tricyclelike combination of aluminum tubing and rubber wheels with a steering wheel and a sail."
                            },
