                                "sense_id": "f9dbe600-dc0d-35fe-8333-118b1f99ae39",
                                "text": "What we hope to achieve with our AAMI Decade of Driving Report, is to bring awareness to where, when and how accidents occur, so that Aussie drivers can be better informed and educated on how to drive more safely. - AAMI Motor Claims Manager Leah James"
                            }
